sparky-stereo-gtk 20261123~sparky9~0 (2026-11-23)
  * The Sparky-Stereo-Oxygen and Sparky-Stereo-Oxygen-Dark themes gain a GTK 2 part, KDE's Oxygen engine (oxygen-gtk's gtkrc), so a GTK 2 program wears Oxygen under the session's own theme name as Qt programs do; Depends on gtk2-engines-oxygen. GTK 3 and 4 keep their parts (queue row 59; Daniel, 2026-10-05: "yes, oxygen widget style and decoration as default too")
  * tools/build_packages.sh: --gtk-only builds the GTK package without remaking an accepted look archive, and each package's source is rebuilt and gated as sparky-stereo-look's are, which keeps its .buildinfo, .changes and build record

